{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03349","headline":"和库部李员外秋夜寓直之作 · 宋之问","name":"和库部李员外秋夜寓直之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相庭贻庆远，才子拜郎初。\n起草徯仙阁，焚香卧直庐。\n更深河欲断，节劲柳偏疎。\n气耿凌云笔，心摇待漏车。\n叨荣厕俦侣，省己恧空虚。\n徒裴阳春和，难参丽曲余。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03349.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03349","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}